{"id": "ds:259:208:Dialogue Text", "source": "Violet", "sourceSha256": "2a36428839a37e680cdce701c1100a695cf2cac101f81f594ba4ec8c8c8a8d3b", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "7c8912a1a9ea4a6992a895e5676b630442ee35aa02b7b360f7f1bd7569413530"}
{"id": "ds:259:209:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]I have to admit… we make a pretty good team.", "sourceSha256": "cabee7310f5899c069cf9ce689cf5680231b9098597ea715a8fa4398564734b3", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ad0657debf6f57446999a71a5a73ad7de0a902f1d36cb2da5119e2f25a959292"}
{"id": "ds:259:210:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]But let’s be honest.", "sourceSha256": "ce925fefbd41478ead169843df918ccf8123c08fc10c17b49074a453620550a3", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "7d83e144fd076ee2ecf61ed639852f7644fe99249371f9b05a326b8739b668db"}
{"id": "ds:259:211:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Your designs wouldn’t work without my foundation and technique.", "sourceSha256": "ec08585fb503d9f42603b8fcaa9ee8f466dcce1101245767e64f1be07b212367", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "18fa677b5907237f89c433b59330ead03694cd98cad357bdc7ca2bfb9052407f"}
{"id": "ds:259:212:Dialogue Text", "source": "Claire", "sourceSha256": "4660c3e4c8287faa464926876a1a6ad2a414c2cc74f818ecb298a87f94be1fa0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ddf88721664023c5180846ba45cbe21117ea47339cad7c98b142d5520815eae0"}
{"id": "ds:259:213:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=6]Oh this again?", "sourceSha256": "cdebd0bbdac5350c07b476f6307bb42e522adf41c7d3f39584c1e66323d628bc", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "637d9e0c7e1ec431b1579de5446da1f7ae83ffb7276dd1efe7f9105ee78c656c"}
{"id": "ds:259:214:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=7]Vi, no one’s gonna wanna WEAR ‘solid foundation and technique.’", "sourceSha256": "6ea082c2b3ab08fd96068d8c2c667ec2803fdb41e66aa09870313dad4d9f8b55", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "9e0af8657b9749065107ec21caedc9c8de951feead8d7ca3f7eace7e6851f108"}
{"id": "ds:259:215:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]It’s gotta LOOK good too.", "sourceSha256": "4b0e7b4b645e2899a306171e7a8c109daa0cd2cb5af7a1a0f1e26509336ee2d1", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "00f3f2f3667ab72a3b60b1cf560a743221ad42e88aaa03f45284a9bbd41748c8"}
{"id": "ds:259:216:Dialogue Text", "source": "Violet", "sourceSha256": "2a36428839a37e680cdce701c1100a695cf2cac101f81f594ba4ec8c8c8a8d3b", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "cc9b6cc3cfec74680bc6a1b6159d54379197b746fee90271dbb9ef508c6ea94c"}
{"id": "ds:259:217:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=7]Are you saying I can’t make it LOOK good?", "sourceSha256": "efedde1913a66b231e8649cc6088535fcd80ba9f12e16a9e32a9eb9d81e66123", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "f8d8989cd4d53164278e9c54a5977e4b653b65e3740dfff9132ecd1679217a21"}
{"id": "ds:259:218:Dialogue Text", "source": "Claire", "sourceSha256": "4660c3e4c8287faa464926876a1a6ad2a414c2cc74f818ecb298a87f94be1fa0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "626e870ce69354493521f23bb7234ff27427bada89776acadb68e6179de0c8f4"}
{"id": "ds:259:219:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]That’s kinda what I’m saying, yeah.", "sourceSha256": "1c735b4181d850adf7845476300114454848e560cb670bfed2b5285394382c6c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "9b318deffca1b6a8b47206df5f6bdb731cd8dbb66d93e9761e4c0a6e6562de67"}
{"id": "ds:259:220:Dialogue Text", "source": "Heyyyy, let’s take a step back.", "sourceSha256": "4121939feeb6eebfbc653c4dc059279a8231d0a37c1147b02e5402cc30565ed9", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ccaead752d690edc2c1d46328c190ea5b7e36063cf47e58050bf21d1af02b580"}
{"id": "ds:259:221:Dialogue Text", "source": "Oy! Calm down!", "sourceSha256": "1216d0ac32497cdc99c0c4b992752b248a3b544e75da963e5110cf7f251099dd", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a903805098d502578da54d6cee0c377c7dbbe15f799953dfae3514f7c1f4b807"}
{"id": "ds:259:222:Dialogue Text", "source": "Claire", "sourceSha256": "4660c3e4c8287faa464926876a1a6ad2a414c2cc74f818ecb298a87f94be1fa0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "1a55173e84214b4b55226f0162fda5f1f12c003f0acc5f9ac78877f89605f627"}
{"id": "ds:259:223:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Eh heh, Rascal don’t mind our bickering.", "sourceSha256": "4680d9b3c737aa5649590c5d1ad0ae8a577a6e209438692e5c66dd7954cc7f7c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "8afa0727dca07385e046fcac513c296440b4be94aa8a5b1cbae78aa844a9afbe"}
{"id": "ds:259:224:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]We get under each other’s skin, but we’re besties to the core.", "sourceSha256": "7bcd2530f6be90abf645d16600fe40bf80e192d74b45c1b14bd5927b47ffad86", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "329c6b9a96904514ede1eaac60b02dbd84d99e174d3de3a4cc3febe4e3e4f73a"}
{"id": "ds:259:225:Dialogue Text", "source": "Violet", "sourceSha256": "2a36428839a37e680cdce701c1100a695cf2cac101f81f594ba4ec8c8c8a8d3b", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "94e9d734c23cea1640e52032b5fbdef12e314ec9921bf683fadbfb862b5cf375"}
{"id": "ds:259:226:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=6]She’s right.", "sourceSha256": "c87a7576d39c8131ab0479a80e68edcdab10e6b7b17301a124423a06fd130364", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ed2ac73b7284a8f6526f46d9e24231b6d7d9301f99dd6f79e9f2ac96a3c56365"}
{"id": "ds:259:227:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Can’t live with her, can’t live without her.", "sourceSha256": "afe14a3c9a11ff8f022474f93f4844feedc8e7507bf9a4894d900909ba0162dd", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "c5b578e0b3f3d23b13e1c3952a85ac594f5c687671c568d0ba22dc002b405e32"}
{"id": "ds:331:571:Dialogue Text", "source": "Penny:", "sourceSha256": "e59dc3ef5c8d172e359c8ec577727b519e80f715dc81eced5361ab86e1b7e7f0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "e7d6e62372116d2e7f1a5c7ef9de4ebd6750fbe40bb5242f610c35730d86c0f5"}
{"id": "ds:331:572:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Hey Rascal!", "sourceSha256": "6484f37ebfa9bbbc37236fe11e024f1350574ff5ac5e39d17f156ad741805dfe", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "9070d6ebdc3e5e24fc23cc3535e29f9dc181b7185cc63604ff50983abdeabbe6"}
{"id": "ds:331:573:Dialogue Text", "source": "Evening ladies! What are you two up to?", "sourceSha256": "1032dc119d9166dce772f0fd007f341fbbc6bcbd0f767a094ed827481b6e7c1e", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "b3fe3baea0dcd322e98a1fcdd1e769ac67f00e423138110751098af4332e34dd"}
{"id": "ds:331:574:Dialogue Text", "source": "Mabel:", "sourceSha256": "94d9863bcf945df691c93c07656adfab65b823d721d887d2c72f649187ef3833", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "387c2bd04ae509662abd8732923f62bfec1eddab502c3d242de2f57b1dc3ed10"}
{"id": "ds:331:575:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Penny and I were just talking about setting up a date with the plant-", "sourceSha256": "c5c9152903ecc1592d9e6b71eba13ee4b1b6d3e24db9fd023fd4bc7de9385f76", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "f1f41f5c71c72bb4ab70a8e3c06f80e48fd34d7d06d2ae614b36c8823e2c1d5d"}
{"id": "ds:331:576:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]OH MY GOSH, I JUST REMEMBERED! Rascal recently had his own experience with the plant!", "sourceSha256": "a89807a4b903e62388d896a60c115b50db458dc9062aed1e555419a2c310123c", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "9e7f7da570e5571027302245f873962202c845262d7c0e9c995c002535df18a9"}
{"id": "ds:331:577:Dialogue Text", "source": "Penny:", "sourceSha256": "e59dc3ef5c8d172e359c8ec577727b519e80f715dc81eced5361ab86e1b7e7f0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "e364fb5d2e79beab833b15e5355c347ed40966670672c2f1ec1eebd5f000d461"}
{"id": "ds:331:579:Dialogue Text", "source": "I did! It got well acquainted with my rear…", "sourceSha256": "92e45399fe3fb8832a1a8259af8a783feebcf0eaec7a118febc098e8ffb7ea9d", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "293bd5bc1c3e98855ca52ec32fd0cc53766398951d11a8eacb4354aa7fc29141"}
{"id": "ds:331:580:Dialogue Text", "source": "Penny:", "sourceSha256": "e59dc3ef5c8d172e359c8ec577727b519e80f715dc81eced5361ab86e1b7e7f0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "a05275fe6a96252d91ec4d0498c4ecddd3ddd3549b26c68b1c0662d05d976f34"}
{"id": "ds:331:581:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]Hah! No kiddin?", "sourceSha256": "27fac76308ba17618797f2ca6d3d9a3577a8231728d992d1cd8eba834dc347fe", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "863f606c54e976ba2b52a443efb301ad4c99f9fbf9a8a76d98b7518045620c15"}
{"id": "ds:331:582:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=6]You’re quite adventurous Rascal.", "sourceSha256": "0bd6c40587548683be1b83687e4293cd217abe0f805552bd6b2ce0b3a4720ff0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "cb98c45163dde638c9e8fc43ffb30b919a3c2857bf16c2c8028d01f71b36abdb"}
{"id": "ds:331:615:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Great! I’ll move some things around and get back to you!", "sourceSha256": "889ce90c69a7a1ea4b5fe5115364f1e033e1d778ff8e20d36d4ee52a82d20f35", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "5a6000e29f25601fecfbc4588188c94178403aad893c4f1d4ddfa65cfbff8b4d"}
{"id": "ds:331:616:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Till then, Penny and I were making plans to visit our little plant friend…", "sourceSha256": "fbb96aab443f172268816c3ba66c0be821fcf9e9e498c535249bb9e7b98513e5", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "b7670b8bb3d5f2149c31d80208877c598d57cba920c6c76c18231bd88bd9cd96"}
{"id": "ds:331:617:Dialogue Text", "source": "Penny:", "sourceSha256": "e59dc3ef5c8d172e359c8ec577727b519e80f715dc81eced5361ab86e1b7e7f0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "dd6add7dd5a446788b2703845c31cda80633df3715023de9b1e19298de7b82f0"}
{"id": "ds:331:618:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]Mabel, hearing you call anything \"little\" is bizarre…", "sourceSha256": "1bb6806eb8074923f40c761ecb22563f67128122f815c4796fc636e61f5ae356", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "753fdab3b1a24743dd9d8cd9a1a457151333ba99ef3dca578e805e0ae0f98d12"}
{"id": "ds:331:619:Dialogue Text", "source": "Mabel:", "sourceSha256": "94d9863bcf945df691c93c07656adfab65b823d721d887d2c72f649187ef3833", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "ac53d4133576de8122dcc16f3dbcbbd9a6a7286ac21ca67741d11d9948544a79"}
{"id": "ds:331:620:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]I got it from you! You’re always calling it \"your little plant friend!\"", "sourceSha256": "7f4b3686d09c2bbbb6689f39876cb94ca03afc248a5605350034092c1323c53f", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "37c293be3064f3736dd0f7d95ae81b92d07aae989197e63ba2bf1553a226e730"}
{"id": "ds:331:621:Dialogue Text", "source": "Do you see the plant often, Penny?", "sourceSha256": "1109221817d07c2aa7b2f266249a095b255757e6f7b88a885d1e4f0cd9824e67", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "89d2535c71f5d04f4fbe74011e140722ca6cf300f6b6434f6e19f7e90dae1b79"}
{"id": "ds:331:622:Dialogue Text", "source": "Penny:", "sourceSha256": "e59dc3ef5c8d172e359c8ec577727b519e80f715dc81eced5361ab86e1b7e7f0", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "057b8190c1a59f26cfd875cb9913a34d1d22418d153392160759d07a8a3645b7"}
{"id": "ds:331:623:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]I do! We go way back!", "sourceSha256": "c07338a747543527ca17bb141e674268752bc74bcc39890419517131379f7a07", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "df343d2b74053545a3371b76a8249aabdd6cf5202c583d3be268912e695c75cd"}
{"id": "ds:67:100:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Also, if he needs a paw, let him know I’m more than happy to help!", "sourceSha256": "36b198afc9a97bcaf89053c3637ef611b4b6931b263f88115ee207ce2f0a23d2", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "5d2fd4b8a32c813706b298bb3c9276f323342cfe62bf34ca1a01abb267b31a55"}
{"id": "ds:67:101:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=2]…", "sourceSha256": "a74d039d5a44e27d61678c0c4cc37101dbf8b95f5d9c94eddc8f1f453533b169", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "7eb7a6357c7580b2398b625b2ef19049e0227677a17c6d982458b32611ddf42f"}
{"id": "ds:67:102:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=1]In any case, he can give those a shot!", "sourceSha256": "1c52187933f8a7d702e0b968c3f48cb566c3202fdc1275135c8ac66be9733e1d", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "206fd4bfb485ef8045eaa8ce8c106171b9788265358aaeb3f4fe6740bc14e457"}
{"id": "ds:67:103:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]But to be honest, they always smell of urine, so I’m assuming they’re for something else.", "sourceSha256": "bc1ff5ec961940756cae5c2af1536607cb76053e56b76de91301cdfb86440f2a", "originalPacket": "localization/editorial-delivery/five-new-locales-20261101-01/uk/repair-01/independent-delta-input.jsonl", "originalRowSha256": "fd213de6093a8215941a2f1ce3ad54e6875c6dacf588cef352dc6d626e51acd7"}
